tes URL-acquired contracts before consumption and after dispatch, reacquires stale compilers without reconnecting, and binds exact request-body digests while retaining complete typed invocation arguments. It also rejects observer path traversal/encoding ambiguity.\n\nThe same generic Capability ABI, RCIR owner, request compiler, exact-origin authority, confirmation and seven operations remain. Different authorised calls retain separate single-use leases; changed/unavailable schemas deny stale writes, and post-dispatch change stays unknown without retry. Host-selected separate read-back can prove the requested external state; 200 with wrong state remains a signed failure.\n\nValidation: combined native suite 587 tests, 26 explicit skips, zero failures; 29 real-HTTP provider-effect controls; original frozen seven-control public proof plus frozen ten-control live-schema proof; release build and existing setup/MCP/core checks. Exact-head remote checks are required before merge. Actual REDs, unchanged assertions, effect logs, new source/binary identities and interim failures are preserved under `evidence/rcir-production-20261007/`.\n\nNo new substrate, version, immutable tag, release asset, Homebrew pin or client configuration is changed. G3 real issuer-enforced downscoping/production trust, G4 streams/recovery, remaining routes/host products and eleven-substrate/fresh-install/reconnected-client release acceptance remain separate unfinished gates. See the execution ledger and release-readiness report.\n\nSecurity review additionally reproduced and fixed obsolete Bonjour acquisition restoration, identical-ID reappearance without an intervening engine lookup, and ambient auth-cookie inheritance by a credential-free observer. Owner-minted acquisition stamps use the existing ABI; isolated observer sessions do not forward ambient cookies/credentials. Frozen real-provider controls and independent unchanged review wrappers pass. The source package explicitly retains the required test provider, with deterministic double-build package verification; freshly extracted production acceptance passes all 29 unchanged controls with zero skips/failures. All 177 packaged source files remain byte-identical after testing. This is source-package acceptance, separate from a precompiled bottle or installation.\n","created_at":"2026-10-07T13:26:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T13:31:31Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"5ea8481960a199fdf8bf4b92add06cec676be0fd","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossbuckley1990-hash/rightclick/pulls/47/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossbuckley1990-hash/rightclick/pulls/47/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossbuckley1990-hash/rightclick/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossbuckley1990-hash/rightclick/issues/47/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rossbuckley1990-hash/rightclick/statuses/57b5d87cc54c26c2b444fb232bb2ffa8e49b34c3","head":{"label":"rossbuckley1990-hash:feature/rcir-live-contracts-20261007","ref":"feature/rcir-live-contracts-20261007","sha":"57b5d87cc54c26c2b444fb232bb2ffa8e49b34c3","user":{"login":"rossbuckley1990-hash","id":255341254,"node_id":"U_kgDODzgyxg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255341254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rossbuckley1990-hash","html_url":"https://github.com/rossbuckley1990-hash","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rossbuckley1990-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rossbuckley1990-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rossbuckley1990-hash/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rossbuckley1990-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rossbuckley1990-hash/subscriptions","o